[00:14.29]I spent so long just wandering
[00:17.97]For years I was adrift
[00:22.61]Directionless and wayward lost
[00:25.17]Like a swallow on a cliff
[00:28.89]But slowly I found purpose
[00:31.75]And my life became more clear
[00:35.95]I found my destination
[00:38.97]But now, where to go from here?
[00:43.07]Cuz I'm already there, I'm already everywhere
[00:50.87]I'm already there, I'm already everywhere
[00:57.67]I've got a wife, two kids and a picket fence
[01:02.09]Everything was hazy, now it's making sense
[01:07.81]Alright, I made it, so now what?
[01:12.53]I paid my dues in factories
[01:16.03]I worked until I bled
[01:19.49]The suffering made me stronger
[01:22.61]So I pushed to get ahead
[01:27.01]Now I'm perched above the factory floor
[01:30.31]Looking down at my friends below
[01:34.13]In my comfy car I drive away
[01:37.57]But there's nowhere left to go
[01:41.27]Cuz I'm already there, I'm already everywhere
[01:49.03]I'm already there, I'm already everywhere
